# Community OS — generated EmDash plugin packages

GENERATED by codegraph (`emdash_plugin` / `emdash_plugin_scaffold`) — do not
edit by hand. Regenerate via the codegraph pipeline with the `emdash_plugins`
profile feature. Hand-written extension code lives in each package's
`src/bespoke.ts` (imported by the generated `admin.ts` / `plugin.ts`).

Each `emdash-community-<domain>` package is a self-contained EmDash plugin:
descriptor (`src/index.ts`), sandbox plugin (`src/plugin.ts`), and a Block Kit
admin surface (`src/admin.ts`) backed by the Fern SDK via `sdkCall`.

